\p
\v 1 \add ≈So\add* Shelomoh¦158146 was¦158144 king¦158145 over¦158148 all¦158150 Yisrael¦158152,
\v 2 and¦158155 these¦158155 were¦158156 his officials¦158156:
\q1 Tsadok's¦158163 son¦158161 Azaryahu¦158160 was¦158156 the¦158156 priest¦158164.
\q1
\v 3 Shisha's¦158170 sons¦158169 Elihoref¦158167 and¦158168 Ahiyah¦158168 were¦158171 secretaries¦158171.
