\q1
\v 5 Natan's¦158193 son¦158191 Azaryahu was¦158201 supervisor of¦158191 the¦158196 governors¦158196,
\q1 and¦158197 his son Zavud¦158197 was a priest¦158201 and adviser to the king¦158203.
