\q1
\v 13 Ben¦158319-Geber¦158321 in¦158322 Ramot¦158322-Gilead, including the¦158325 villages¦158325 of¦158325 Menashsheh's¦158329 son¦158327 Yair¦158326 that¦158330 were¦158331 in¦158331 Gilead, as well as the¦158333 Argov¦158334 area¦158333 in¦158336 the Bashan¦158336 region¦158333, and including sixty¦158337 large¦158339 cities¦158338 with¦158322 walls¦158340 and¦158341 bronze¦158342 \add gate\add* bars.
