\v 15 saying¦160911, “Blessed¦160912 is¦160912 Yahweh¦160913, the god¦160914 of¦160914 Yisrael¦160915, who¦160916 spoke¦160917 \add ≈audibly to¦160924\add* my¦160921 father¦160921 David¦160920, and¦160911 then¦160911 put into action the promise he'd given,
\v 16 ‘From¦160942 the day¦160928 when¦160929 I brought¦160930 my people Yisrael out¦160930 of¦160933 Egypt¦160937, I didn't¦160938 choose a city¦160941 from¦160937 \add among\add* all¦160942 the¦160943 tribes¦160943 of¦160943 Yisrael¦160944 to¦160945 build¦160945 a house¦160946 \add in\add* so that my name¦160948 would be¦160952 \add established\add* there¦160949. \add ≈Instead\add* I chose¦160940 David¦160951 to¦160952 \add ≈lead\add* my people Yisrael¦160956.’ ”\x + \xo 8:16: \xt 2Sam 7:4-11; 1Ch 17:3-10.\x*
